Usage:
  rez3asm <file.rza> [--emit-c | --emit-lib] [-o <file.c>]
  rez3asm --lsp
  rez3asm --help
  rez3asm --version

Modes:
  (default)       Validate the source without generating C.
  --emit-c        Generate a standalone C23 program with main.
  --emit-lib      Generate a C23 library without main for a C host.
  -o <file.c>     Write C to a file; also enables C generation.
  --lsp           Start the LSP server on standard input and output.
  --help          Print this help and exit.
  --version       Print the compiler version and exit.

Without -o, generated C is written to standard output.

Exit status:
  0  Success.
  1  Source validation failed.
  2  Command-line usage or file I/O error.
